{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20270","headline":"古钗叹 · 张籍","name":"古钗叹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古钗堕井无颜色，百尺泥中今复得。\n凤凰宛转有古仪，欲爲首饰不称时。\n女伴传看不知主，罗袖拂拭生光辉。\n兰膏已尽股半折，雕文刻样无年月。\n虽离井底入匣中，不用还与坠时同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20270.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20270","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}